WEBVTT

1
00:00:18.162 --> 00:00:21.223
burst into tears at the sight of Jimmy as an old man.

2
00:00:21.243 --> 00:00:25.305
"Don't cry, little girl," said Jimmy.

3
00:00:26.265 --> 00:00:29.446
The children quickly realized that he didn't know them anymore.

4
00:00:30.787 --> 00:00:33.148
The middle-aged Ugly-Wugly approached Jimmy.

5
00:00:37.172 --> 00:00:39.314
The two men seemed to recognize each other.

6
00:00:39.675 --> 00:00:41.056
They started to walk away.

7
00:00:44.719 --> 00:00:46.501
no!" said Kathleen.

8
00:00:46.521 --> 00:00:48.943
"Where are they going?

9
00:00:49.484 --> 00:00:52.026
What will happen to Jimmy when the spell breaks?"

10
00:00:52.046 --> 00:00:55.349
"Don't worry," said Gerald.

11
00:00:55.369 --> 00:00:57.131
"I'll follow Jimmy.

12
00:00:57.531 --> 00:00:59.733
Clean up the Ugly-Wuglies and then go home.

13
00:01:00.154 --> 00:01:02.616
You can tell Mademoiselle that Jimmy and I are with an uncle."

14
00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:13.382
Kathleen and Mabel gathered up the pile of old clothes, hockey sticks, and brooms.

15
00:01:14.383 --> 00:01:17.224
That was all that was left of the six Ugly-Wuglies.

16
00:01:17.244 --> 00:01:21.746
"Let's hide them in the stone dinosaur," said Mabel.

17
00:01:21.766 --> 00:01:23.347
"He's hollow."

18
00:01:23.367 --> 00:01:28.569
"Then we can have a nice tea party with our dolls," said Kathleen.

19
00:01:28.589 --> 00:01:32.531
"That'll make us forget all about this magic."

20
00:01:37.568 --> 00:01:40.410
The girls hid everything in the belly of the dinosaur.

21
00:01:44.893 --> 00:01:46.854
Then they returned to the school for tea.

22
00:01:47.755 --> 00:01:50.357
But Kathleen couldn't forget about the magic.

23
00:01:51.237 --> 00:01:52.979
She was still worried about her brothers.

24
00:01:54.660 --> 00:01:56.921
Meanwhile Gerald got on the train.

25
00:01:57.742 --> 00:02:00.484
He followed Jimmy and the Ugly-Wugly to London.

26
00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:07.682
Then he followed them into an office building.

27
00:02:15.609 --> 00:02:17.831
On one door it said, "Mr.

28
00:02:18.111 --> 00:02:18.832
U. W.

29
00:02:19.012 --> 00:02:20.513
Ugli, Stockbroker."

30
00:02:22.054 --> 00:02:25.057
On the next floor, Gerald saw a door with Jimmy's name on it.

31
00:02:29.541 --> 00:02:30.622
He didn't know what to do.

32
00:02:31.503 --> 00:02:32.844
So he sat on the stairs.

33
00:02:34.940 --> 00:02:37.321
A messenger boy came down the steps, whistling.

34
00:02:37.341 --> 00:02:39.963
"What are you doing here?"

35
00:02:40.463 --> 00:02:41.304
he asked Gerald.

36
00:02:41.324 --> 00:02:45.806
"Uh I'm a detective.

37
00:02:46.546 --> 00:02:47.567
What do you know about Mr.

38
00:02:47.647 --> 00:02:51.909
Ugli?" "He's awfully rich," said the boy.

39
00:02:51.929 --> 00:02:54.511
"And what about that other man upstairs?"

40
00:02:55.971 --> 00:02:57.112
"He's even richer!

41
00:02:57.632 --> 00:02:58.653
Those two are rivals.

42
00:02:59.453 --> 00:03:00.854
Why are you so interested in them?"

43
00:03:02.415 --> 00:03:04.196
Gerald had to think up an excuse.

44
00:03:05.912 --> 00:03:07.974
"That man upstairs is wanted by his family.

45
00:03:08.374 --> 00:03:09.836
I need to get him out of his office."

46
00:03:09.856 --> 00:03:11.938
"I think Mr.

47
00:03:12.078 --> 00:03:14.640
Ugli would be glad to be rid of him for a day or two.

48
00:03:15.221 --> 00:03:16.382
Go in and ask him for help."

49
00:03:19.124 --> 00:03:22.067
With that, the messenger boy left Gerald on the stairs.

50
00:03:23.528 --> 00:03:26.631
After a few minutes of thinking, Gerald came up with a plan.

51
00:03:29.193 --> 00:03:30.214
He went into Mr.

52
00:03:30.254 --> 00:03:31.816
Ugli's office and talked to him.

53
00:03:36.556 --> 00:03:37.617
At lunchtime Mr.

54
00:03:37.737 --> 00:03:39.858
Ugli and Jimmy went out to a restaurant.

55
00:03:41.199 --> 00:03:43.901
Gerald followed them and sat at a table nearby.

56
00:03:46.422 --> 00:03:48.303
The restaurant was crowded and noisy.

57
00:03:49.544 --> 00:03:51.305
But Gerald could still hear Mr.

58
00:03:51.425 --> 00:03:52.946
Ugli asking about the ring.

59
00:03:52.966 --> 00:03:58.330
"Oh yes, this is a family treasure," said Jimmy.

60
00:03:58.350 --> 00:04:00.671
"May I look more closely at it?"

61
00:04:01.111 --> 00:04:01.451
asked Mr.

62
00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:06.961
Ugli. Then he took the ring from Jimmy's finger.

63
00:04:08.381 --> 00:04:09.241
And he dropped it.

64
00:04:11.782 --> 00:04:13.222
Just as Gerald and Mr.

65
00:04:13.342 --> 00:04:14.343
Ugli had planned!

66
00:04:15.963 --> 00:04:17.303
Gerald pounced on the ring.

67
00:04:18.584 --> 00:04:20.964
He put it on his own finger and made a wish.

68
00:04:20.984 --> 00:04:25.906
"I wish Jimmy and I were inside the secret passage in the Temple of Flora."

69
00:04:26.846 --> 00:04:29.147
It was the first safe place he could think of.

70
00:04:30.807 --> 00:04:31.827
Gerald felt dizzy.

71
00:04:32.588 --> 00:04:33.808
Everything was very dark.

72
00:04:35.112 --> 00:04:37.813
How was he going to deal with Jimmy until the spell wore off?

73
00:04:39.414 --> 00:04:40.834
But there was no need to worry.

74
00:04:40.854 --> 00:04:43.896
"Gerald! Are you awake?

75
00:04:44.496 --> 00:04:46.457
I had such a strange dream."

76
00:04:47.557 --> 00:04:49.318
Jimmy had returned to normal.

77
00:04:49.338 --> 00:04:52.519
"It's that ring again," said Gerald.

78
00:04:52.539 --> 00:04:56.221
"I had to wish us here to get you out of your dream."

79
00:04:58.141 --> 00:04:59.082
"Where are we?"

80
00:04:59.102 --> 00:05:02.503
"In the passage behind the Temple of Flora."

81
00:05:03.844 --> 00:05:06.110
"But how are we going to get out?"

82
00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:07.191
asked Jimmy.

83
00:05:07.211 --> 00:05:10.474
"I'll wish us out, of course," said Gerald.

84
00:05:12.996 --> 00:05:15.278
So he wished but nothing happened.

85
00:05:16.660 --> 00:05:18.802
He handed the ring to Jimmy in the darkness.

86
00:05:20.203 --> 00:05:22.405
Jimmy wished and nothing happened.

87
00:05:23.406 --> 00:05:24.788
The boys were trapped.
